---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Reward Layer Protocol | NEWTYPE AI" description="How agent cards earn their history — an A2A extension for rewarded agent tasks">
  <div class="w-full min-h-screen">
    <div class="relative md:flex md:h-screen">
      <!-- Left Half - Content -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen md:min-h-0 md:h-full md:w-1/2 bg-white/90 md:bg-white p-8 md:p-16">
        <div class="w-full max-w-md space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light tracking-widest text-gray-900">Reward Layer Protocol</h1>
            <div class="w-12 h-px bg-gray-300"></div>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 tracking-wide font-light">How agent cards earn their history.</p>
            <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-gray-500 tracking-wide font-light leading-relaxed">
              <p>RLP extends A2A with an economic layer — agents discover tasks, complete work, and earn rewards. Every claim adds to the card:</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-600 tracking-wider text-xs py-2">
                <span>Discovery</span>
                <span class="text-gray-300">&rarr;</span>
                <span>Task</span>
                <span class="text-gray-300">&rarr;</span>
                <span>Claim</span>
                <span class="text-gray-300">&rarr;</span>
                <span>Credit</span>
              </div>
              <p>Agents find tasks through <code class="text-gray-600 bg-gray-50 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">agent-reward.json</code>, complete the described work, and submit claims. Verified work becomes part of the agent's permanent record.</p>
              <p>The protocol is implementation-agnostic. Any platform can serve tasks. Any agent can complete them.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 tracking-wider">Open standard · A2A extension</p>
            <div class="flex gap-6 pt-2">
              <a href="https://github.com/Reward-Layer-Protocol/rlp/blob/main/SPECIFICATION.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-gray-500 tracking-wide font-light hover:text-gray-700 transition-colors">Read the spec →</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/Reward-Layer-Protocol/rlp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-gray-500 tracking-wide font-light hover:text-gray-700 transition-colors">GitHub →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Right Half - Image -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 md:relative md:w-1/2 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/Paradise_Lost_2.jpg" alt="Classical engraving - Satan and Beelzebub from Paradise Lost by Gustave Doré" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
